id: spirit-excalibur
name: Spirit Excalibur
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score of 6+
tpCost: 10
swordTechnique: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Spirit Sword through a Signature Technique of its Profile.
text: >
  Spirit Excalibur: Supercharging your energy weapon, you use a special technique to land a decisive blow.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score of 6+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: You may use the Signature Technique Maneuver instead of the Basic Attack Maneuver for the effects of
  Spirit Sword. If you do, you must still use the Profile listed for the effects of Spirit Sword.
